flowchart TB
    App[WhatsApp, email, messages, social app] --> Intent[ACTION_VIEW HTTP/HTTPS intent]
    Intent --> Android[Android chooser / role resolver]
    Android --> PHNX[PHNX Browser]
    PHNX --> Policy{External-link profile policy}
    Policy -->|Default profile| Default[Open in default profile]
    Policy -->|Ask| Picker[Show allowed profile picker]
    Policy -->|Last active| Last[Open in last active profile]
    Picker --> Selected[User selects profile]
    Default --> Validate[Validate URL and scheme]
    Last --> Validate
    Selected --> Validate
    Validate --> Open[Open in selected profile]

